# Tts.action
# This action implements a TTS (Text-to-Speech) action.
# It takes a string as the speech input and returns a boolean when the action is done.
# The action server is responsible of sending the Speech obtained as a result to the corresponding
# speaker.
# Feedback consists of the sentence that is being processed and its duration.

# Goal
string speech
---
# Result
bool finished
---
# Feedback
uint8 sentences
builtin_interfaces/Time duration
